T{
\fB\-\:config\fR \fIFILE\fR
T}	T{
Configuration file. Default \fB/\:etc/\:xproxy/\:xot.\:yaml\fR (\fB/\:usr/\:local/\:etc/\:xproxy/\:xot.\:yaml\fR on macOS).
T}
T{
\fB\-\:validate\fR
T}	T{
Load and validate the configuration,\: report every problem,\: and exit with status 0 when it is valid and 1 otherwise. Nothing is bound. The whole file is checked,\: siblings\(aq listeners included,\: and the summary says how many of them this daemon would serve.
T}
T{
\fB\-\:version\fR
T}	T{
Print the version,\: commit and build date,\: and exit.
T}
