.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.PP
0 after a clean stop or a successful \fB\-validate\fR; 1 when the configuration does not load, a listener cannot be bound or validation fails; 2 on a usage error.
.SH "ENVIRONMENT"
.PP
\fBLISTEN_FDS\fR, \fBLISTEN_PID\fR and \fBLISTEN_FDNAMES\fR are read for systemd socket activation. \fBNOTIFY_SOCKET\fR receives readiness and reload notifications.
